# No co-authorship

A commit has one author: the human already set in this repo's git author. Do not add a second author.

- Never add `Co-authored-by`, including `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`.
- Never add an agent, Cursor, or another person on `Signed-off-by`.
- Do not change git config, and do not invent an author name or email.

```text
Add Door Interpreter so a doorbell can be read as a picture, a caption, and one scene line.
```

If a trailer appears after the commit is written, remove it before pushing. Do not push a commit that contains `Co-authored-by`.
